Subject: Re: Plotting coefficients in mixedmirt, and unipolar item response models
Message-ID: <-z0Wzw9Z0TU.WFVLFiWNFgAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <-z0Wzw9Z0TU.nWs_dBEIEQAJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
