I don't specifically follow what you are asking for. You are looking for the goodness of fit or the first moments (i.e., means) of the items? There's very little information in those moments, which is why we typically use at least the first and second to assess the overall goodness of fit. See the M2() function for this. For individual item fit, which seems to be what you are looking for, see the itemfit() function.

Phil

