70 times! Those poor individuals....

>
> In order to account for within-person dependence, I am treating each individual as a "group" and each measurement becomes an independent "person".
> First I tried fitting mirt to models separately. Since in some groups some items had no scores (i.e. all response were zero) I got this error:
> > Error: The following items have only one response category and cannot be estimated: Angry, Anxious.
